---
/**
 * Daily games on the home page (D-61, D-63): one calm silk scene after "ways to study", with the heading, one line and
 * a way into today's games. Like the other sections below the first screen, it fades in once (D-62). It has its own
 * scene, between the tint of "ways to study" and the launch-updates panel.
 */
---

<section id="daily-games" class="scene scene-play scroll-mt-section py-section" aria-labelledby="games-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-prose px-gutter text-center" data-reveal-section>
    <h2 id="games-heading" class="display text-title sm:text-title-lg">daily games</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">two short puzzles a day, a word to guess and terms to sort, with more on the way.</p>
    <a
      href="/play"
      class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-pill bg-button px-6 py-3 text-on-button no-underline hover:bg-button-hover hover:text-on-button"
      data-testid="games-link"
    >
      play today's games
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
